      "mulaIast": "kaivalyaśrutyā tāvadātmā nirguṇaḥ | nanu- `bṛhanto'sya dharmā' iti śrutyā\n`brahmeśānādibhirdevaiḥ sametairyadguṇāṃśakaḥ |\nnāvasāyayituṃ śakyo vyācakṣāṇaiśca sarvadā ||'\n\niti smṛtyā ca brahma, dharmavat, padārthatvād'- ityādyanumānena ca svasamānasattākadharmavad brahmeti cet, maivam, na tāvat śrutyā saguṇatvasiddhiḥ, saguṇaprakaraṇasthāyā upāstividhiviṣayaviśeṣaṇasamarpakatvena tatparatvābhāvāt | na cāpūrvatvāt satyakāmādau viśeṣaṇe tātparyam | apūrvatve'pyanyaśeṣasyātatparatvadarśanād, yathā hi `jarttilayavāgvā vā juhuyād gavīdhukayavāgvā vā juhuyā'dityādau jarttilayavāgvāderhomasādhanatvasya `anāhutivai jarttilāśca gavīdhukāśce'pi nindāyāśca `ajakṣīreṇa juhotī'ti vidhyekavākyatayā atatparatvaṃ, tathaivātrāpyupapatteḥ | nirguṇaprakaraṇasthāyāstu advitīyabrahmapratipattyanukūlaniṣedhāpekṣitaviṣayasamarpakatayā anyathāsiddheḥ | na ca `kiñcane'tyādisāmānyavācakapadenaiva brahmātiriktasarvaniṣedhyopasthitau viśeṣagrahaṇamanarthakamiti vācyam, alaukikatayā vākyaprameyatvabhramavyudāsārthatvāt | ata eva śrutiprāptasya śrutyā niṣedhe ahiṃsāvākyam agniṣomīyahiṃsāyā, agrahaṇavākyaṃ ca ṣoḍaśigrahaṇasya, asadvetyādivākyaṃ brahmasattvasya bhedavākyaṃ caikyasya niṣedhakaṃ syāditi nirastam, prakṛte śrutiprāptasyaivābhāvāt | śrutiprāptatvaṃ hi na tatprasaktatvam, atiprasaṅgāt, tatpramitatvasya ca prakṛte abhāvāt | ahiṃsāvākyasyāvaidhahiṃsāviṣayatvena samānaviṣayatvābhāvāt, samānaviṣayatve grahaṇāgrahaṇavadvikalpāpatteḥ | grahaṇāgrahaṇavākyayostu satyapi samānaviṣayatve ekasyādhikabalatvābhāvena bādhyabādhakabhāvasyāsaṃbhāvitatvād, anyathā vikalpānāśrayaṇaprasaṅgāt | asadvākyabhedavākyayostu na brahmasattvaikyaniṣedhakatā, sattyaikyabodhakayoreva tatparatvena prābalyāt |\n\nnāpyanumānaṃ brahmaṇi tāttvikadharmasādhanāyālam | tathā hi- (1) brahma dharmi sattāsamānasattākadharmavad, uktasattākabhāvarūpadharmavadvā, yāvatsvarūpamanuvartamānadharmavadvā, tādṛśabhāvarūpadharmavadvā, svajñānābādhyadharmavadvā, tādṛśabhāvarūpadharmavadvā, dharmairbhāvarūpadharmairvā hīnaṃ nāvatiṣṭhate vā, padārthatvād, athavā bhāvatvād, ghaṭavat | (2) brahma, svajñānābādhyaprakāravat, svāro pitavyāvartakasvajñānābādhyaprakāravadvā, adhiṣṭhānatvāt, śuktivat | (3) brahma svajñānābādhyaduḥkhavyāvartakadharmavad, duḥkhānātmakatvāt, ghaṭavat | (4) brahma, svajñānābādhyaprakāraviśeṣyam, sandigdhatvāt, vicāryatvāt, nirṇetavyatvādvā sthāṇuvat | (5) brhama, vedāntatātparyagocaraprakāravat, vedāntavicāraviṣayatvāt, yadevaṃ tadevam, yathā karmakāṇḍavicāraviṣayo dharmaḥ | (6) īśvaraḥ, sadāvāptasamastakalyāṇaguṇaḥ, sadā prepsutve sati tatra śaktatvāt, yo yadā yatprepsuryatra śaktaḥ sa tadā tadvān, yathā caitraḥ | (7) īśvaraḥ, sadā tyaktasamastadoṣaḥ, sadā tajjihāsutve sati tattyāge śaktatvāt, yaścaivaṃ sa tathā, yathā caitraḥ ityādyanumāneṣu dharmipadasvapadayoryatkiñciddharmiyatkiñcitsaṃbandhiparatve ghaṭādisamasattākakalpitadharmavattvena siddhasādhanam, brahmaparatve sādhyāprasiddhiḥ, ghaṭādidharmaṃ brahmasamāna sattākatvāderaprasiddheḥ |\n\nna ca- dṛṣṭānte sādhyanirūpaṇe tadeva dharmi, pakṣe tannirūpaṇe brahmaiva dharmi, dharmipadasvapadādīnāṃ samabhivyāhṛtaparatvāditi vācyam, śabdasvabhāvopanyāsasyānumānaṃ pratyaprayojakatvāt | svarūpapadasyāpyevameva brahmaparatve sādhyāprasiddhiḥ, ghathaṭādiparatve siddhasādhanam | samabhivyāhṛtaparatvasya śabdasvabhāvasyānumānaṃ pratyaprayojakatvamiti dūṣaṇaṃ pūrvavat | dharmairvinā nāvatiṣṭhata ityasya brahma dharmavyāptamityarthaḥ | tathā ca siddhasādhanam, yasmin kāle deśe vā brahma, tatra, dharmā satyeva | na hi kālo deśo vā dharmarahitaḥ, māyācitsaṃbandhasya kālasya muktyasahavṛttitvāt | svajñānābādhyetyatrāpi pūrvavat svapadārthavikalpaḥ | ata eva- svāropitavyāvartakasvajñānābādhyadharmavaditi nirastam, svajñānābādhyaduḥkhavyāvartakadharmavadityatrāpi svapadārthavikalpaḥ pūrvavat | duḥkhavyāvartakadharmavattvena siddhasādhanam | vedāntatātparyagocaretyatrāvāntaratātparyamādāya siddhasādhanam | mukhyatastātparyoktau ca vedāntavākyamukhyatātparyaviṣayaprakārā prasiddhyā sādhyāprasiddhiḥ | na ca yattadbhyāmanugamayya sādhyaprasiddhiḥ, tathā śabdānugamasyānumānaṃ pratyanupayogāt | īśvaraḥ sadāvāptasamastakalyāṇaguṇa ityatra kālaṃ vyāpya āptaguṇatvasyāsmābhirapyaṅgīkārāt | na hi nirdharmakatāyāṃ satyāṃ kālasaṃbandho'sti | kiṃ ca śuddhasya pakṣīkaraṇe hetvasiddhiḥ, upahitasya pakṣīkaraṇe arthāntaram, svābhinnāptasamastakalyāṇaguṇatvena sadharmakatvāyogācca, siddhasādhanācca kalyāṇaguṇānāmānandādīnāṃ nityatvena tatprepsāyāstatra sāmarthyasya ca tvayāpi vaktumaśakyatvācca | ata eva prepsādikaṃ prajñānaghanatvāditi- nirastam | sadā tyaktasamasta doṣatve sādhye caramavṛttiparyantatyāge sāmarthyābhāvena hetvasiddheḥ | yadā tu tatsāmarthyam, tadā tyaktadoṣatvamiṣṭameva | prakāravattvādau sādhye aprayojakatvamapi | na ca adhiṣṭhānatva sandigdhatvādyanupapattirevānukūlastarkaḥ, adhiṣṭhānatve hi svāropitavyāvartakavattvaṃ tantraṃ kalpitākalpitasādhāraṇamityuktatvāt, svajñānābādhyatvaviśiṣṭadharmaṃ vinā tasyānupapattyabhāvāt | sandigdhatvamapi vyāvartakena kalpitenākalpitena vā rūpeṇāniścitatayaivopapadyata iti tasyāpi nāniścitasādhyadharmaṃ vinānupapattiḥ | evaṃ duḥkhānātmakatvaṃ duḥkhavyāvartakasvarūpatayaivopapannaṃ kadācidvaktavyam, anyathā anavasthānāpatteḥ | na hi vyāvartakadharmo'pi kevalānvayī, yena svavṛttiḥ syāt | tathā ca tadapi vyāvartakadharmaṃ vināpyupapannaṃ na tatsādhanāyālam | anavasthābhiyā kvaciddharme viśrāntau padārthatvamapi vyabhicāryeva | na ca svasyaiva svavṛttitvānna vyabhicāraḥ, ātmāśrayāt | na caivaṃ dṛśyatvasyāpi svasminnavṛttyā bhāgāsiddhiḥ, svavṛttitvābhāve'pi svaniṣṭhātyantābhāvapratiyogitvasya tatrāsiddhatāprayojakasyābhāvāt | tasmānnānumānaṃ brahmasamasattākadharme pramāṇam |"
